The '''Sybaris''' is a burst-fire {{Faction|Tenno}} lever-action rifle that fires two bullets in quick succession, and serves as the Tenno equivalent to the {{Weapon|Grinlok}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals equal physical damage.

{{Advantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Burst|}}
{{Disadvantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Burst|}}

